<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Happy Diwali | Festival of Lights</title>
    <style>
        /* Base Reset & Theme Colors */
        * {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            box-sizing: border-box;
            font-family: 'Segoe UI', Tahoma, Geneva, Verdana, sans-serif;
        }

        body {
            background-color: #1a0033; /* Deep spiritual purple */
            color: #fff;
            overflow-x: hidden;
        }

        /* Header Styling */
        header {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #4a0072, #e65100);
            padding: 20px;
            text-align: center;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 15px rgba(0,0,0,0.5);
        }

        header h1 {
            color: #ffd700; /* Gold */
            font-size: 2.5rem;
            margin-bottom: 5px;
            text-shadow: 2px 2px 4px rgba(0,0,0,0.6);
        }

        header p {
            font-size: 1.1rem;
            color: #ffe082;
            letter-spacing: 1px;
        }

        /* Hero Section with Animated Diya */
        .hero {
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            text-align: center;
            padding: 60px 20px;
            background: radial-gradient(circle, #330066 0%, #1a0033 100%);
        }

        .diya-container {
            margin-bottom: 20px;
            position: relative;
        }

        /* CSS Diya Art */
        .flame {
            width: 30px;
            height: 45px;
            background: linear-gradient(to bottom, #ffeb3b, #ff9800, #f44336);
            border-radius: 50% 50% 20% 20% / 60% 60% 40% 40%;
            margin: 0 auto;
            animation: flicker 0.15s ease-in-out infinite alternate;
            box-shadow: 0 0 20px #ff9800, 0 0 40px #ffeb3b;
        }

        .diya-base {
            width: 100px;
            height: 50px;
            background: linear-gradient(to bottom, #d84315, #8e24aa);
            border-radius: 0 0 50px 50px;
            border-top: 5px solid #ffb300;
            margin-top: -5px;
        }

        @keyframes flicker {
            0% { transform: scale(1); }
            100% { transform: scale(1.05) skewX(2deg); }
        }

        .hero h2 {
            font-size: 3rem;
            color: #ffb300;
            margin: 15px 0;
            text-shadow: 0 0 10px rgba(255, 179, 0, 0.4);
        }

        .hero p {
            max-width: 600px;
            font-size: 1.2rem;
            line-height: 1.6;
            color: #f5f5f5;
        }

        /* Info & Celebrations Grid */
        .wishes-grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(280px, 1fr));
            gap: 25px;
            max-width: 1200px;
            margin: 40px auto;
            padding: 0 20px;
        }

        .card {
            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05);
            border: 1px solid rgba(255, 215, 0, 0.2);
            border-radius: 12px;
            padding: 25px;
            text-align: center;
            transition: transform 0.3s ease, box-shadow 0.3s ease;
        }

        .card:hover {
            transform: translateY(-5px);
            box-shadow: 0 8px 25px rgba(255, 179, 0, 0.2);
            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
        }

        .card-icon {
            font-size: 2.5rem;
            margin-bottom: 15px;
        }

        .card h3 {
            color: #ffb300;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
            font-size: 1.4rem;
        }

        .card p {
            font-size: 0.95rem;
            color: #e0e0e0;
            line-height: 1.5;
        }

        /* Footer Styling */
        footer {
            background-color: #0d001a;
            text-align: center;
            padding: 20px;
            margin-top: 40px;
            border-top: 2px solid #4a0072;
            font-size: 0.9rem;
            color: #b3b3b3;
        }

        footer span {
            color: #ffb300;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

    <!-- Header Section -->
    <header>
        <h1>Shubh Deepawali</h1>
        <p>Celebrating the Triumph of Light Over Darkness</p>
    </header>

    <!-- Hero / Main Greeting Section -->
    <section class="hero">
        <div class="diya-container">
            <div class="flame"></div>
            <div class="diya-base"></div>
        </div>
        <h2>Happy Diwali!</h2>
        <p>May the divine light of Diwali spread into your life peace, prosperity, happiness, and good health. Wishing you and your family a safe and blessed festival of lights.</p>
    </section>

    <!-- Highlights / Traditions Section -->
    <section class="wishes-grid">
        <div class="card">
            <div class="card-icon">🪔</div>
            <h3>Light a Diya</h3>
            <p>Dispel the darkness of ignorance and bring the warm glow of joy, knowledge, and prosperity into your household.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="card">
            <div class="card-icon">🎨</div>
            <h3>Colorful Rangoli</h3>
            <p>Decorate your doorsteps with beautiful patterns to welcome Goddess Lakshmi and bring good luck to your family.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="card">
            <div class="card-icon">🍬</div>
            <h3>Share Sweets</h3>
            <p>Spread sweetness and love by exchanging delicious festive treats and gifts with friends, family, and neighbors.</p>
        </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Footer Section -->
    <footer>
        <p>&copy; 2026 Festive Greetings. Made with <span>🪔</span> for Diwali.</p>
    </footer>

</body>
</html>
